Subject: [PATCH] W6 web wallet: real-tx-field confirmation view derived
 exclusively from the transaction bytes (D-W6-1), claim binding with
 recipient/amount substitution refusals, confirmation binding with blind
 tripwire (D-W6-2), phishing policy https-only + ASCII-host homoglyph gate
 (D-W6-3), strict auralite://sign deep links (D-W6-4), reproducible aura-keys
 WASM build (8 exports, 0 imports, double-build pin) + untrusted MV3 extension
 glue (D-W6-5); gate 10 scenarios + named control ui_recipient_substitution
 (NC: recipient substitution in UI -> red), 6 NC mutations (662 cumulative),
 docs + evidence

